---
source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/cases/harness.rs
expression: help
---
Resolve a pending start by verifying a thread or allowing a fresh start

Usage: instrukt sessions resolve-start [OPTIONS] <--session <SESSION>|--none> <KEY>

Arguments:
  <KEY>  Durable start key, or the home-standing shorthand `<procedure>@<project>`

Options:
      --session <SESSION>  The session the runtime created, `<runtime>:<id>`
      --none               Allow a fresh start after confirming no thread or creation remains. A
                           retained first thread must be proven absent
      --json               Print the resolution as JSON
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
